      "content": "1. Definition of Conjunction"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Conjunctions are words used to join words, phrases, clauses, or sentences together.",
        "Coordinating conjunctions connect words or clauses of equal grammatical rank.",
        "Subordinating conjunctions connect a main independent clause to a dependent subordinate clause.",
        "Correlative conjunctions always function in pairs to join parallel grammatical elements.",
        "Mastering correct conjunction pairs is critical for sentence correction and error detection questions."
      ],
      "id": "3n58b9d"
