      "content": "7. Uses of Some Important Conjunctions"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Always pair 'No sooner' with 'than' (never 'when' or 'then').",
        "Pair 'Hardly' and 'Scarcely' with 'when' or 'before', never with 'than'.",
        "'Lest' must always be followed by 'should' (or plain verb) and should never be used with 'not'.",
        "Avoid redundant conjunction pairs like using 'although' and 'but' in the same sentence."
      ],
      "id": "7rsptvp"
